@startuml UC14_Logout_Sequence_Diagram

title UC14: Logout - Sequence Diagram

actor "End User" as User
participant "Frontend" as Frontend

User -> Frontend: Select "Log out"
Frontend -> Frontend: Call Appwrite Web SDK\naccount.deleteSession('current')
Frontend -> Frontend: SDK clears the stored session\nfrom local persistence (this device only)

note over Frontend
  Option A - local-only logout: deletes only
  this device's session, no User Actions
  Server call, no revocation of other
  sessions. Other devices/sessions remain
  logged in; a JWT minted before logout
  still works elsewhere until it naturally
  expires (~15 min).
end note

Frontend -> User: Redirect to login form (UC1)

@enduml
